<a href="http://www.sln.suny.edu/ADMIN/SLN/catalog/slncat.nsf/7002dad410c84b91852568b700528f88/c61e2ed17a4d4f0e852568b90048a535?OpenDocument">CHAOS: The Self Organizing Universe</a>.
<br><br>  

<li>
<a href="http://eclectic.ss.uci.edu/~drwhite/">Douglas White</a> of the
<a href="http://www.uci.edu/">University of California Irvine</a> uses
<i>CBofN</i> as a recommended and collateral reading in his 
<a
href="http://eclectic.ss.uci.edu/~drwhite/Anthro179a/syllabus.htm">Social
Dynamics and Self Organizing Systems</a> course.
<br><br>  

<li>
<a href="http://hornacek.coa.edu/dave/index.html">David P. Feldman</a>
